     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<br><br>I&#39;m working on a dynamic UI in a Shiny app I&#39;m creating.  Basically, I&#39;m trying to implement a &quot;select/deselect all&quot; checkboxInput, which dynamically selects/deselects another checkboxGroupInput&#39;s selected values.  I got this to work pretty easily, by creating a renderUI component in server.R and a uiOutput component in ui.R.  The problem now is that I don&#39;t know how to access the selection from uiOutput, which I need for rendering a plot in server.R.  Here&#39;s the code (omitting irrelevant lines of code):<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R<br><br>fluidRow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  column</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">12</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> checkboxInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;selectAllStrains&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Select/Deselect all strains&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>fluidRow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  column</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">12</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;selectStrains&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R<br><br>output$selectStrains </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$selectAllStrains </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        checkboxGroupInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;strains&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                           label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> h3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Mouse Strains&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                           choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rownames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mousedata</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                           selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rownames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mousedata</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        checkboxGroupInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;strains&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                           label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> h3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Mouse Strains&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                           choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rownames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mousedata</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                           vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mode</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;character&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>Here&#39;s the server.R component that requires the data from the uiOutput in ui.R.<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">output$heatmap </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Take a dependency on input$recalculate</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      input$recalculate<br>      <br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Use isolate() to avoid dependency on input$strains and input$regions</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      mousedatamat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mousedata</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">isolate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$selectStrains</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> isolate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$regions</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      nr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mousedatamat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      nc </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mousedatamat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      <br>      heatmap</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mousedatamat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> distfun</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">jdfs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bluered</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> margins</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">14</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> trace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;none&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cexRow </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">log10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cexCol </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">log10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> density</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">info</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;histogram&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> keysize</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> symkey</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> symbreaks</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     <br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><br>Note here that input$recalculate is just an action button, input$regions is basically the same as strains, but not dynamic, and mousedatamat is just some data that is loaded in global.R.  I&#39;ve tried accessing input$selectStrains and input$strains, and neither one works for me.  Specifically, I&#39;m getting the error:<br><br>Listening on <a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:7298\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://127.0.0.1:7298&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792400660658000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Fx-W52XIhgBIxEy5hyq9V\">http://127.0.0.1:7298</a><br>Error in heatmap.2(mousedatamat, distfun = jdfs, col = bluered, margins = c(8,  : <br>  `x&#39; must have at least 2 rows and 2 columns<br><br>Thanks for the help!<br></div>"
