     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Initially I had posted question because I didn&#39;t see any solutions online after about a 30 minute Google search.  Just to let everyone know -- I resolved the issue.  What I did, was I added some error checking before the heatmap.2 call, like so:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R<br><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">min</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mousedatamat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span></div></code></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><code><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">heatmap</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span></span><span style=\"color:#066\"><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">mousedatamat</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> distfun</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">jdfs</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> col</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">bluered</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> margins</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:#066\"><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:#066\"><span style=\"color:#066\">14</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> trace</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#080\"><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;none&quot;</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> cexRow </span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:#066\"><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:#066\"><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">log10</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">nr</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> cexCol </span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:#066\"><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:#066\"><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">log10</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">nc</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> density</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">info</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#080\"><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;histogram&quot;</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> keysize</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#066\"><span style=\"color:#066\">0.8</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> symkey</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> symbreaks</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span></code></div></code></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div></div></code></div><br>I should also note that when you generate a dynamic UI component in server.R and display it in ui.R with a uiOutput call, to refer to its values in server.R you need to use the inputId of the dynamic UI component you specified in server.R, NOT the outputId in uiOutput.  So in fact my initial post was incorrect because it really should have been isolate(input$strains), not isolate(input$selectStrains).<br><br>Cheers<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
